h/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch24-applied/05-the-qr-algorithm.html"}